'''Atomix''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Atomix's Species|unknown species]] from an unknown planet.

==Appearance==
Atomix has a humanoid robotic appearance. He has a green and white body with large cylinders on his arms near his wrists, that are full of green energy with dark green bubble-like spheres, which constantly move. He has the same energy on his Omnitrix-shaped chest. His eyes are green and his head is a pointed, armored helmet filled with the same bubbling green energy from his arms. He is mouthless.{{Refn|[[:File:Atomix is mouthless.png]]|group = DJW}}

Atomix wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his green and white belt.

==Personality==
Atomix, unlike many of Ben's other transformations, induces a notable shift in his demeanor. He adopts a highly formal and almost theatrical persona, characterized by a strong sense of justice and a penchant for grand pronouncements. This manifests in his respectful address, employing proper titles like "grandfather" and "cousin" when speaking to Max and Gwen, respectively. Furthermore, he possesses a flair for dramatic flair, frequently naming his powerful attacks in a style reminiscent of anime heroes.

