{{Quote|HAA-MEE-NA HAA-MEE-NA HAA-MEE-NA HAA-MEE-NA HAA-MEE-NA! Try a little fusion cuisine, catered by Atomix!|Atomix.<ref name="TVSB">''[[The Vampire Strikes Back]]''</ref>}}
Atomix can create nuclear energy using his hands, which can do a massive amount of damage to its surroundings.

The way Atomix creates his nuclear energy is by chanting "HAA-MEE-NA HAA-MEE-NA HAA-MEE-NA-HA!"{{Refn|[[:File:Atomix Chant.png]]|group = DJW}} It is not crucial for him to chant every attack, but doing so will focus an attack's power and cause substantially more damage.{{Refn|[[:File:Atomix's Chant Helps Him Focus.png]]|group = DJW}}

Atomix is able to activate his cylinders on his arms and his Omnitrix-shaped chest to melt nearby objects, such as an [[Ultimate Arachnachimp]]'s webs.<ref name="FaFBM">''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref>

Atomix is capable of flight and, as such, he can perform a flying ramming attack called the Fissile Whistle.<ref name="FaFBM"/>

Atomix is strong enough to take out an [[Ultimate Vaxasaurian]] with a single punch, and kick an object up nearly past a planet's atmosphere.<ref name="FaFBM"/>

Atomix can generate a massive blast of energy dubbed the "Nuclear Winner". This move can easily knock out enemies, as well as devastate the surrounding area.<ref name="FaFBM"/>

Atomix's hard body gives him substantial protection against physical attacks.<ref name="MA">''[[Malgax Attacks]]''</ref>

Atomix can generate an orb of nuclear energy called a Fusion Cuisine, which can generate a very bright light capable of burning up [[Ectonurite (Classic)|Ectonurite]]s and greatly harming [[Vladat]]s. He can also make the attack continue even after he reverts to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].<ref name="TVSB" /> With enough work, Atomix can generate a Fusion Cuisine orb the size of the sun.{{Refn|[[:File:Atomix Can Make a Sun.png]]|group = DR}}

Atomix can glow in the dark.{{Refn|[[:File:Atomix Glows in the Dark.png]]|group = DJW}}

Although he has never trained himself to do so, Atomix can reproduce gamma radiation.{{Refn|[[:File:Atomix Gamma Radiation.png]]|group = DJW}}

==Weaknesses==
[[File:MA (306).png|thumb|218x218px|Stamina Limit]]
{{Quote|Give up now and... I'll just go home. I'm really tired.|Atomix, after losing all of his stamina.<ref name="MA" />}}
Atomix has limited stamina, meaning that he can get tired after using up most of his energy.<ref name="MA" />

Atomix is boundlessly overconfident and can cause a total meltdown.{{Refn|[[:File:Atomix Overconfident.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Atomix first appeared in ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', where he was accidentally unlocked and named by [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]], and defeated [[Albedo|Negative]] [[Ultimate Humungousaur]] and Negative [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]].
*In ''[[The Vampire Strikes Back]]'', Atomix created a light fusion to burn up [[Zs'Skayr]] and harm [[Lord Transyl]]. He then made the 'Fusion Cuisine' stay active just in case Zs'Skayr ever came back to [[Z'Castle Zs'Skayr]].
*In ''[[Weapon XI: Part 1]]'', Atomix broke into the [[Rooters]]' [[Rooter Headquarters|headquarters]].
*In ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', Atomix was defeated by [[Malware Armor|Mal]][[Vilgax (Classic)|gax]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Atomix appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

===[[Original Future Timeline|Original Future]]===
*Atomix was mentioned in ''[[Ken 10]]'' as one of [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]]'s aliens. To [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]]'s disappointment, Atomix was not one of the aliens in the [[Omnitrix (Ken's Replica)|Omnitrix]] given to him by his father.

